P02	GetPayment	Retrieve a payment by ID with appropriate access checks.
P03	GetPaymentByReference	Find a payment using a trusted business reference or merchant reference.
P04	ListPayments	List payments for an authorized customer or permitted internal caller, with bounded pagination.
